[wave 1] start d-06, d-07, d-09, d-08
**Wave 1.** Four directions run in parallel.
- Build the final quantitative DW exclusion: f_s=1 line from sterile-nu tools vs Lyman-alpha mapped floors and digitized X-ray sin^2(2theta) limits, with binding constraint per mass.
- Cross-check thermal-relic to DW sterile mass mapping and quantify floor spread from alternative prescriptions.
- Quantify BBN/CMB Delta N_eff and Yp/D/H shifts for DW grid and test eV-scale SBL anomaly thermalization control.
- Verify Lyman-alpha WDM systematics and Planck tension claims against full texts with citable quotes.
