[direction] d-10 -> blocked (Tool budget exhausted before text-quoted X-ray limits could be extracted; web_search DNS failures and no read_arxiv_chunk/cite execution left f_s,max_Xray and binding table incomplete)
**Blocked — Compute binding DW constraint from text-quoted X-ray decay limits without figure digitization.** Tool budget exhausted before text-quoted X-ray limits could be extracted; web_search DNS failures and no read_arxiv_chunk/cite execution left f_s,max_Xray and binding table incomplete. Direction d-10 asked for binding Dodelson-Widrow (non-resonant oscillation production) constraint from text-quoted X-ray decay limits without figure digitization. What was established: linear scaling of relic density Omega_s h^2 (sterile neutrino contribution to cosmic density) with mixing sin^2(2theta) was verified locally with sterile-nu tools. At sin^2=1e-12 Omega_s h^2 = 0.0004715 at 7.1 keV, 0.003041 at 20 keV, 0.00361 at 22 keV, 0.005936 at 29 keV, 0.01309 at 45 keV; at sin^2=1e-11 values are exactly 10x larger (0.004715, 0.03041, 0.1309 at 7.1, 20, 45 keV), confirming Omega_s h^2 proportional to sin^2. This anchors f_s=1 (100% of dark matter, Omega_s h^2=0.12) mixings at 2.55e-10 (7.1 keV), 3.95e-11 (20 keV), 3.32e-11 (22 keV), 2.02e-11 (29 keV), 9.17e-12 (45 keV) for f_s,max_Xray = sin^2_Xray / sin^2(f_s=1) calculation. Files saved to /Users/nramachandra/hep-genesis-testing/projects/ramp-research-lyman-wdm/runs/261107_183057/sterile_nu_grid_DW_bc0526.csv and sterile_nu_grid_DW_2d0f4d.csv. What ran: predict_sterile_nu_grid locally for 5+3 points; web_search for Dessert+2020, Roach+2022, Foster+2021 returned only generic abstracts or DNS failures. What was not done: verbatim quotes for X-ray sin^2(2theta) or Gamma limits at 7.1, 20, 22, 29, 45 keV (E_gamma = m_s/2), .bib entries with section/equation numbers, f_s,max_Xray for tool vs Abazajian/ALS normalisations (3-16x offset), Lyman-alpha DW floors from Viel mapping, binding-constraint table per mass, and exclusion plot. No figures produced in this direction. Blocked by tool budget (10 calls) before read_arxiv_chunk/cite could execute.
