**Critic, wave 2.** Three findings stand up to the evidence. Ten are questioned:
- "DW relic density scales linearly with mixing at low sin^2(2theta): at sin^2=1e-12…" — Evidence tc-261107_1-w2-d-10-106 excerpt shows only the 7.1 keV row (omega_s h2=0.0004715 at sin2=1e-12). It does not contain the claimed values for 20, 22, 29, 45 keV (0.003041, 0.00361, 0.005936, 0.01309) nor the derived f_s=1 mixings 2.55e-10, 3.95e-11, 3.32e-11, 2.02e-11, 9.17e-12.
- "Mixed-DM fraction limits in 2504.06367 and 0812.0010 are derived for thermal-relic WDM…" — Evidence tc-261107_1-w1-d-07-42, tc-261107_1-w1-d-08-35, tc-261107_1-w1-d-08-36 contain only figure-extraction success and generic WDM 5.7/5.3 keV snippets. They contain no mixed-DM fraction limit curves from 2504.06367 or 0812.0010 and no Viel mapping coefficient 4.43 keV*(m_WDM/keV)^{4/3}.
- "1702.01764 (Irsic et al.) reports thermal-relic WDM lower limit m_WDM > 5.3 keV at…" — Evidence tc-261107_1-w2-d-08-102 excerpt describes XQ-100 + HIRES/MIKE samples but is truncated before any limit value. It does not contain m_WDM >5.3 keV, 2-sigma/95% CL, or improved hydrodynamical modeling quote.
- "Linear Omega_s h^2 scaling verified: at sin^2(2theta)=1e-11 Omega_s h^2 = 0.004715 at…" — Evidence tc-261107_1-w2-d-10-106 and tc-261107_1-w2-d-10-115 excerpts show only the 7.1 keV rows (0.0004715 at 1e-12 and 0.004715 at 1e-11). They do not contain the claimed 20 keV (0.03041) and 45 keV (0.1309) values needed to verify exact 10x linear scaling at those masses.

The critic also noted:
- Thermal-relic to DW mapping remains unquoted: Viel 2005 Eq.5 coefficient 4.43 and alpha(m_WDM) formula not extracted via read_arxiv_chunk, and alternative prescriptions (half-mode, Bozek/Murgia, Abazajian) not tabulated to quantify floor spread in keV/%.
- Lyman-alpha WDM limits 5.3 keV (1702.01764) and 5.7 keV (2309.04533) lack citable quotes for k_max cuts, T(z) priors, peculiar velocities, patchy reionization, and Planck tension; SDSS DR14 1911.09073 and Rogers & Poulin re-analyses unverified due to DNS failures and budget exhaustion.
- Binding DW constraint incomplete: no text-quoted X-ray sin2(2theta) or Gamma limits at E_gamma=m_s/2 for 7.1,20,22,29,45 keV from Dessert+2020, Roach+2020/2022, Foster+2021; f_s,max_Xray and Lyman-alpha vs X-ray binding table not built.
